
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8" />
    <title>异常</title>
    <link href="/Content/CSS/error.css" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>
<body style="height:100%;width:100%;">
    <div class="center">
        <div class="main">
            <div class="left">
                <img src="/Content/imgs/errorImg.png" />
            </div>
            <div class="right">
                <h1>sorry，您访问的页面发生了异常</h1>
                <div>提示信息：发生异常，请联系管理员！</div>
                    <div id="btn">
                        您可以通过以下方式继续访问...<br />
                        <a class="btn" href="/Home/Index">返回首页</a>
                    </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    
</body>
</html>
<script type="text/javascript">
    
    if (location.href.toLowerCase() != top.location.href.toLowerCase()) {
        document.getElementById('btn').style.display = "none";
    }
</script>